<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Cal-Maine Foods Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Cal-Maine Foods Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			Cal-Maine Foods Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			CALM.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $6.50-$7.50/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.7 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  800,000 Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,006,800</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		  Paulson Investment Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment   375,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: The Jackson, Miss. company produces, cleans, grades, packages and sells fresh shell eggs and manufactures and sells egg products.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To provide additional funds for possible future acquisitions, increase working capital and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s for year ended June 1:</p>
<p>				  1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		$282,844	   $242,649</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)   $10,925	    ($8,685)</p>
